# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E).
# The four positions of the focus: New Game, Load Game, Settings, and Load Game again.
\[5\.30\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=13 .* focus
\[5\.90\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=85 .* focus
\[6\.50\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=121 .* focus
\[7\.10\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=85 .* focus
# The Enter key on the Settings button opens the settings menu.
\[9\.70\].* window +MenuSettings 
